  "instructions": [
    "Wash the celery stalks, trim ends, and slice them sashimi-style thinly.",
    "In a small bowl whisk together lime juice, olive oil, minced garlic, chili flakes, honey, salt and pepper until well blended.",
    "Place the sliced celery in a large bowl and pour the dressing over it, tossing to coat all pieces evenly.",
    "Add chopped cilantro and thinly sliced red onion, then toss again to distribute flavors.",
    "Refrigerate the salad for 10 minutes to let the flavors meld before serving."
